{
  "$comment": [
    "Items: free-text questions whose answer is one number (counts, years, ages, durations, height, weight, doses) are retyped to integer or decimal, with a UCUM unit and generous limits that catch typos. Free-text questions that may hold several values (e.g. twins' birth weights, years of several miscarriages, sleep from–to) or clock times stay free text.",
    "Population (milestone 10): only positive evidence fills an answer; an absence of records never answers 'no'. Codes are checked with npm run verify-codes (fhir/terminology-check.md). Collections: active Conditions, active AllergyIntolerances, active MedicationStatements and MedicationRequests (medicationCodeableConcept only), completed Immunizations, final Observations.",
    "Texts (found in the print view, milestone 11): the category 'Previous pregnancies and childbirths' has its fi text in English and its en text in Swedish; the fi text is taken from the first question under it ('Aikaisemmat raskaudet ja synnytykset'). The 'Ohje' category is untranslated in sv and en; translated as in the other forms."
  ],
